This feature fully supplants https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/73001, allowing you to do things like:

```rust
use Default::default;

struct S {
    a: HashMap<i32, i32>,
}

impl S {
    fn new() -> S {
        S {
            a: default()
        }
    }
}
```
and more.

